# ── Fixtures are LOCAL. This repo is public. ──────────────────────────────
# The corpus is 256 published articles. Committing them here would mirror the
# whole archive onto GitHub, search-indexable — including the ~74 deliberately
# unlisted so Medium would not distribute them. Unlisting is a topic decision,
# and republishing them on GitHub would override it.
#
# Only test/fixtures/public/ is committed: a small curated set plus the
# synthetic worst-case file, enough for CI.
test/fixtures/*
!test/fixtures/README.md
!test/fixtures/public/

.idea/
.vscode/

# build info
*.tsbuildinfo
